<title>USA: E*Trade started with accumulate.</title>
<headline>E*Trade started with accumulate.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-09-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Deutsche Morgan Greenfell/C.J. Lawrence analyst Mark Wolfenberger said he initiated coverage of E*Trade Group Inc with an accumulate rating and a 12-month price target of $18.</p>
<p>&quot;(W)e believe there is huge upside potential in (E*Trade's) current electronic brokerage market as well as significant opportunities for same platform revenue diversification into other on-line markets,&quot; Wolfenberger said in a research note.</p>
<p>&quot;We belive (E*Trade) could become a leading virtual information services platform.&quot;</p>
<p>-- Shares were down 1/4 at 8-3/8.  </p>
<p>The shares touched a new low in intraday trading of 8-1/4.</p>
